  "id": "chicken-cashew-salad",
  "name": "Chicken Cashew Salad",
  "subtitle": "A creamy pasta salad with crisp vegetables, chicken, and cashews",
  "description": "Cooked seashell pasta, vegetables, and chicken are tossed with a tangy-sweet dressing, chilled, and finished with crunchy cashews.",
